review_comment:
@korycins I was thinking about that as well. Basically we do not have batching in any other mutation, it was done like that for product in this mutation so I implement the same solution for pages, but I agree is not ok.
I'm wondering if it will be a problem at all for pages, as usually the number of pages is much lower than products.

Maybe I can remove batch for now, and we will move it to task in case it will turn out that the mutation is taking too long time.

